WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:03.126
The info blocks keep score and lives for you.

2
00:00:03.929 --> 00:00:08.729
set life shows hearts, and at zero lives the game ends by itself.

3
00:00:11.347 --> 00:00:14.972
An overlap runs every frame while two sprites touch.

4
00:00:15.926 --> 00:00:20.276
So destroy the enemy when it hits, and it costs just one life.
